    "- **Quality-Filtered Data**: Pre-processed and normalized audio at 22.05kHz\n",
    "- **Voice Cloning Ready**: Multi-speaker dataset with speaker embeddings\n",
    "- **Coqui Format**: Automatic conversion to Coqui training format\n",
    "- **Production Pipeline**: Complete training to deployment workflow\n",
    "\n",
    "### Expected Performance:\n",
    "- **High-Quality TTS**: Natural-sounding Twi speech synthesis\n",
    "- **Voice Cloning**: Few-shot speaker adaptation\n",
    "- **Multi-Speaker**: Support for diverse speaker characteristics"
